<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>NAAB Annual Report</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, "Helvetica";
  }
  th, td {
    border: 1px solid #000;
    padding: 8px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  th {
    background-color: #f0f0f0;
  }
  .section-header {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
</style>

<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  th, td {
    border: 1px solid #000;
    padding: 8px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  th {
    background-color: #f0f0f0;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <h1 style="font-size: 16pt; text-align: center;">NAAB – Annual Report – Part I – Statistical Report</h1>

  <div class="section-header">SECTION A. INSTITUTIONAL CHARACTERISTICS</div>

  <p>1. Program Contact Information:</p>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 20%;">Name</td>
      <td><span data-field="program_contact.name">{{ program_contact.name }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Title</td>
      <td><span data-field="program_contact.title">{{ program_contact.title }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Office Phone Number</td>
      <td><span data-field="program_contact.office_phone_number">{{ program_contact.office_phone_number }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Fax Number</td>
      <td><span data-field="program_contact.fax_number">{{ program_contact.fax_number }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Email</td>
      <td><span data-field="program_contact.email">{{ program_contact.email }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <p>2. Institution Type:</p>
  <p><span data-field="institution_type">{{ institution_type }}</span></p>

  <p>3. Carnegie Classification:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>a. Basic Classification: <span data-field="carnegie_classification.basic">{{ carnegie_classification.basic }}</span></li>
    <li>b. Undergraduate Instructional Program: <span data-field="carnegie_classification.undergraduate_program">{{ carnegie_classification.undergraduate_program }}</span></li>
    <li>c. Graduate Instructional Program: <span data-field="carnegie_classification.graduate_program">{{ carnegie_classification.graduate_program }}</span></li>
    <li>d. Size and Setting: <span data-field="carnegie_classification.size_setting">{{ carnegie_classification.size_setting }}</span></li>
  </ul>

  <p>4. Which regional accreditation agency accredits your institution?</p>
  <p><span data-field="regional_accreditation_agency">{{ regional_accreditation_agency }}</span></p>

  <p>5. In which ACSA region is the institution located?</p>
  <p><span data-field="acsa_region">{{ acsa_region }}</span></p>

  <p>6. Who has direct administrative responsibility for the architecture program?</p>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 20%;">Name</td>
      <td><span data-field="admin_responsibility.name">{{ admin_responsibility.name }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Title</td>
      <td><span data-field="admin_responsibility.title">{{ admin_responsibility.title }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Office Phone Number</td>
      <td><span data-field="admin_responsibility.office_phone_number">{{ admin_responsibility.office_phone_number }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Fax Number</td>
      <td><span data-field="admin_responsibility.fax_number">{{ admin_responsibility.fax_number }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Email</td>
      <td><span data-field="admin_responsibility.email">{{ admin_responsibility.email }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <p>7. To whom should inquiries regarding this questionnaire to be addressed?</p>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 20%;">Name</td>
      <td><span data-field="inquiry_contact.name">{{ inquiry_contact.name }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Title</td>
      <td><span data-field="inquiry_contact.title">{{ inquiry_contact.title }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Office Phone Number</td>
      <td><span data-field="inquiry_contact.office_phone_number">{{ inquiry_contact.office_phone_number }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Fax Number</td>
      <td><span data-field="inquiry_contact.fax_number">{{ inquiry_contact.fax_number }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Email</td>
      <td><span data-field="inquiry_contact.email">{{ inquiry_contact.email }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <p>8. Who is the university administrator responsible for verifying data (and completing IPEDS reports) at your institution?</p>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 20%;">Name</td>
      <td><span data-field="data_verifier.name">{{ data_verifier.name }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Title</td>
      <td><span data-field="data_verifier.title">{{ data_verifier.title }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Office Phone Number</td>
      <td><span data-field="data_verifier.office_phone_number">{{ data_verifier.office_phone_number }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Fax Number</td>
      <td><span data-field="data_verifier.fax_number">{{ data_verifier.fax_number }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Email</td>
      <td><span data-field="data_verifier.email">{{ data_verifier.email }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h1 style="font-size: 16pt; text-align: center;">NAAB – Annual Report – Part I – Statistical Report</h1>

  <div class="section-header">SECTION B – NAAB-ACCREDITED ARCHITECTURE PROGRAMS</div>

  <p>1. DEGREE PROGRAMS</p>
  <p>a. Which NAAB accredited / candidate degree programs were offered during the last fiscal year? (B. Arch, M. Arch, D. Arch)</p>
  <p>Accredited: <span data-field="degree_programs.accredited_degrees">{{ degree_programs.accredited_degrees }}</span></p>
  <p>Candidate: <span data-field="degree_programs.candidate_degrees">{{ degree_programs.candidate_degrees }}</span></p>

  <p>b. Did your institution offer any pre-professional architecture degree programs during the last fiscal year? Yes</p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Degree Type</th>
        <th>Available?</th>
        <th>Full Degree Title</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in degree_programs.pre_professional_degrees %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="degree_programs.pre_professional_degrees[{{ loop.index0 }}].degree_type">{{ degree_programs.pre_professional_degrees[loop.index0].degree_type }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="degree_programs.pre_professional_degrees[{{ loop.index0 }}].available">{{ degree_programs.pre_professional_degrees[loop.index0].available }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="degree_programs.pre_professional_degrees[{{ loop.index0 }}].full_degree_title">{{ degree_programs.pre_professional_degrees[loop.index0].full_degree_title }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <p>c. Did your institution offer any post-professional architecture degree programs during the last fiscal year? Yes</p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Full Degree Title</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in degree_programs.post_professional_degrees %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="degree_programs.post_professional_degrees[{{ loop.index0 }}].full_degree_title">{{ degree_programs.post_professional_degrees[loop.index0].full_degree_title }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <p>d. What is the Classification of Instructional Programs (CIP) Code assigned to your accredited degree program(s)?</p>
  <p><span data-field="cip_codes">{{ cip_codes }}</span></p>

  <p>2. Does your institution have plans to initiate any new NAAB-accredited degree programs?</p>
  <p><span data-field="plans_to_initiate_new_programs">{{ plans_to_initiate_new_programs }}</span></p>

  <p>3. Does your institution have plans to discontinue any of its NAAB-accredited degree programs?</p>
  <p><span data-field="plans_to_discontinue_programs">{{ plans_to_discontinue_programs }}</span></p>

  <p>4. What academic year calendar type does your institution have?</p>
  <p><span data-field="academic_calendar_type">{{ academic_calendar_type }}</span></p>

  <p>5. Articulation Agreements</p>
  <p>Does the architecture program have articulation agreements with local community colleges? No</p>
  <p>If yes, how many articulation agreements does the program have? <span data-field="number_of_articulation_agreements">{{ number_of_articulation_agreements }}</span></p>
  <p>Does the articulation agreement include the B. Arch. degree program? No</p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <p>6. Credit Hours for Completion for each program:</p>
  <p>a. Indicate the total number of credit hours taken at your institution to earn each NAAB accredited/candidate degree program offered by your institution:</p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Program</th>
        <th>Total Credit Hours</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>M. Architecture undergraduate (five years, no baccalaureate degree awarded prior):</td>
        <td><span data-field="credit_hours.m_arch_undergraduate_total">{{ credit_hours.m_arch_undergraduate_total }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>M. Architecture Pre-Professional (degree designed for candidates who have a pre-professional degree in architecture):</td>
        <td><span data-field="credit_hours.m_arch_pre_professional_total">{{ credit_hours.m_arch_pre_professional_total }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>M. Architecture Non-Pre-Professional (degree designed for candidates who have an undergraduate degree in a discipline other than architecture):</td>
        <td><span data-field="credit_hours.m_arch_non_pre_professional_total">{{ credit_hours.m_arch_non_pre_professional_total }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <p>b. By degree, what is the distribution of credit hours in the following: General Education, Professional, and Electives?</p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Program</th>
        <th>General Education</th>
        <th>Professional</th>
        <th>Electives</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>B. Architecture:</td>
        <td><span data-field="credit_hours_distribution.b_arch_gen_ed">{{ credit_hours_distribution.b_arch_gen_ed }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="credit_hours_distribution.b_arch_prof">{{ credit_hours_distribution.b_arch_prof }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="credit_hours_distribution.b_arch_electives">{{ credit_hours_distribution.b_arch_electives }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>M. Architecture undergraduate:</td>
        <td><span data-field="credit_hours_distribution.m_arch_undergraduate_gen_ed">{{ credit_hours_distribution.m_arch_undergraduate_gen_ed }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="credit_hours_distribution.m_arch_undergraduate_prof">{{ credit_hours_distribution.m_arch_undergraduate_prof }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="credit_hours_distribution.m_arch_undergraduate_electives">{{ credit_hours_distribution.m_arch_undergraduate_electives }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>M. Architecture Pre-Professional:</td>
        <td><span data-field="credit_hours_distribution.m_arch_pre_professional_gen_ed">{{ credit_hours_distribution.m_arch_pre_professional_gen_ed }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="credit_hours_distribution.m_arch_pre_professional_prof">{{ credit_hours_distribution.m_arch_pre_professional_prof }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="credit_hours_distribution.m_arch_pre_professional_electives">{{ credit_hours_distribution.m_arch_pre_professional_electives }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>M. Architecture Non-Pre-Professional:</td>
        <td><span data-field="credit_hours_distribution.m_arch_non_pre_professional_gen_ed">{{ credit_hours_distribution.m_arch_non_pre_professional_gen_ed }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="credit_hours_distribution.m_arch_non_pre_professional_prof">{{ credit_hours_distribution.m_arch_non_pre_professional_prof }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="credit_hours_distribution.m_arch_non_pre_professional_electives">{{ credit_hours_distribution.m_arch_non_pre_professional_electives }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <p>7. Online classes offered for each program:</p>
  <p>a. Indicate whether online classes are offered.</p>
  <p><span data-field="online_classes_offered">{{ online_classes_offered }}</span></p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <p>8. Average credit hours per student per term by degree program?</p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Program</th>
        <th>Average Credit Hours</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>B. Architecture:</td>
        <td><span data-field="avg_credit_hours.b_arch">{{ avg_credit_hours.b_arch }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>M. Architecture undergraduate:</td>
        <td><span data-field="avg_credit_hours.m_arch_undergraduate">{{ avg_credit_hours.m_arch_undergraduate }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>M. Architecture Pre-Professional:</td>
        <td><span data-field="avg_credit_hours.m_arch_pre_professional">{{ avg_credit_hours.m_arch_pre_professional }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>M. Architecture Non-Pre-Professional:</td>
        <td><span data-field="avg_credit_hours.m_arch_non_pre_professional">{{ avg_credit_hours.m_arch_non_pre_professional }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <p>9. Is your degree program(s) offered in whole, or in part, at more than one campus or location</p>
  <p><span data-field="offered_at_multiple_locations">{{ offered_at_multiple_locations }}</span></p>
  <p>If YES, please provide location and credit hours offered.</p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>City and State</th>
        <th>Country</th>
        <th>Credit Hours</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in location_details %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="location_details[{{ loop.index0 }}].city_state">{{ location_details[loop.index0].city_state }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="location_details[{{ loop.index0 }}].country">{{ location_details[loop.index0].country }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="location_details[{{ loop.index0 }}].credit_hours">{{ location_details[loop.index0].credit_hours }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="section-header">SECTION C – TUITION, FEES AND FINANCIAL SUPPORT FOR STUDENTS IN NAAB-ACCREDITED PROGRAMS</div>

  <p>1. Tuition is defined as "the amount of money charged to students for instructional services. Tuition may be charged per credit, per term, or per academic year."</p>
  <p>a. What were the tuition and fees for the institution for the last fiscal year?</p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Program</th>
        <th>Full-Time Student (In-State)</th>
        <th>Full-Time Student (Out-of-State)</th>
        <th>Part-Time Student (In-State)</th>
        <th>Part-Time Student (Out-of-State)</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>B. Architecture:</td>
        <td><span data-field="tuition_fees.b_arch_full_time_in_state">{{ tuition_fees.b_arch_full_time_in_state }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="tuition_fees.b_arch_full_time_out_of_state">{{ tuition_fees.b_arch_full_time_out_of_state }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="tuition_fees.b_arch_part_time_in_state">{{ tuition_fees.b_arch_part_time_in_state }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="tuition_fees.b_arch_part_time_out_of_state">{{ tuition_fees.b_arch_part_time_out_of_state }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>M. Architecture:</td>
        <td><span data-field="tuition_fees.m_arch_full_time_in_state">{{ tuition_fees.m_arch_full_time_in_state }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="tuition_fees.m_arch_full_time_out_of_state">{{ tuition_fees.m_arch_full_time_out_of_state }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="tuition_fees.m_arch_part_time_in_state">{{ tuition_fees.m_arch_part_time_in_state }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="tuition_fees.m_arch_part_time_out_of_state">{{ tuition_fees.m_arch_part_time_out_of_state }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>M. Architecture Pre-Professional:</td>
        <td><span data-field="tuition_fees.m_arch_pre_professional_full_time_in_state">{{ tuition_fees.m_arch_pre_professional_full_time_in_state }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="tuition_fees.m_arch_pre_professional_full_time_out_of_state">{{ tuition_fees.m_arch_pre_professional_full_time_out_of_state }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="tuition_fees.m_arch_pre_professional_part_time_in_state">{{ tuition_fees.m_arch_pre_professional_part_time_in_state }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="tuition_fees.m_arch_pre_professional_part_time_out_of_state">{{ tuition_fees.m_arch_pre_professional_part_time_out_of_state }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <p>b. Does the institution offer discounted or differential tuition for a NAAB-accredited degree program? Yes</p>
  <p>c. Is a summer session required for any portion of your accredited degree program(s)? Yes</p>
  <p>If yes, what is the additional tuition and fees for the summer program? Yes, the rates are as follows:</p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Program</th>
        <th>Full-Time Student (In-State)</th>
        <th>Full-Time Student (Out-of-State)</th>
        <th>Part-Time Student (In-State)</th>
        <th>Part-Time Student (Out-of-State)</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>B. Architecture:</td>
        <td><span data-field="summer_tuition_fees.b_arch_full_time_in_state">{{ summer_tuition_fees.b_arch_full_time_in_state }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="summer_tuition_fees.b_arch_full_time_out_of_state">{{ summer_tuition_fees.b_arch_full_time_out_of_state }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="summer_tuition_fees.b_arch_part_time_in_state">{{ summer_tuition_fees.b_arch_part_time_in_state }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="summer_tuition_fees.b_arch_part_time_out_of_state">{{ summer_tuition_fees.b_arch_part_time_out_of_state }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>M. Architecture:</td>
        <td><span data-field="summer_tuition_fees.m_arch_full_time_in_state">{{ summer_tuition_fees.m_arch_full_time_in_state }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="summer_tuition_fees.m_arch_full_time_out_of_state">{{ summer_tuition_fees.m_arch_full_time_out_of_state }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="summer_tuition_fees.m_arch_part_time_in_state">{{ summer_tuition_fees.m_arch_part_time_in_state }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="summer_tuition_fees.m_arch_part_time_out_of_state">{{ summer_tuition_fees.m_arch_part_time_out_of_state }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <p>d. Does the institution offer discounted or differential tuition for summer courses for a NAAB accredited degree program? Yes</p>
  <p>Additional Comments: <span data-field="additional_comments">{{ additional_comments }}</span></p>
  <p>Tuition is per semester credit hour.</p>
  <p>Fees are per year.</p>

  <p>2. Financial Aid:</p>
  <p>a. What was the percent of students financial aid at both the institutional and architecture program levels (grants, loans, assistantships, scholarships, fellowships, tuition waivers, tuition discounts, veteran's benefits, employer aid, and other financial aid)?</p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Grant Type</th>
        <th>% Students Receiving Aid</th>
        <th>Average Amount by Types of Aid</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in financial_aid_by_grant_type %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="financial_aid_by_grant_type[{{ loop.index0 }}].grant_type">{{ financial_aid_by_grant_type[loop.index0].grant_type }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="financial_aid_by_grant_type[{{ loop.index0 }}].percent_receiving_aid">{{ financial_aid_by_grant_type[loop.index0].percent_receiving_aid }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="financial_aid_by_grant_type[{{ loop.index0 }}].average_amount">{{ financial_aid_by_grant_type[loop.index0].average_amount }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Grants</th>
        <th>% Students Receiving Aid</th>
        <th>Average Amount</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>a. Institution Student</td>
        <td><span data-field="financial_aid_summary.institution_student_percent">{{ financial_aid_summary.institution_student_percent }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="financial_aid_summary.institution_student_average">{{ financial_aid_summary.institution_student_average }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>b. Architecture Program</td>
        <td><span data-field="financial_aid_summary.architecture_program_percent">{{ financial_aid_summary.architecture_program_percent }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="financial_aid_summary.architecture_program_average">{{ financial_aid_summary.architecture_program_average }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>c. Architecture Program State/Local Grants</td>
        <td><span data-field="financial_aid_summary.architecture_state_local_percent">{{ financial_aid_summary.architecture_state_local_percent }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="financial_aid_summary.architecture_state_local_average">{{ financial_aid_summary.architecture_state_local_average }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>d. Institutional Grants</td>
        <td><span data-field="financial_aid_summary.institutional_grants_percent">{{ financial_aid_summary.institutional_grants_percent }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="financial_aid_summary.institutional_grants_average">{{ financial_aid_summary.institutional_grants_average }}</span></td>
